    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you love ramen? Do you want to make your own ramen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/aae6df6e2b7e2d475e9c7d3382f9a4bc.poster.avif?t=1743044969\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/aae6df6e2b7e2d475e9c7d3382f9a4bc.webm?t=1743044969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/aae6df6e2b7e2d475e9c7d3382f9a4bc.mp4?t=1743044969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will make your dream come true; you will be fascinated and immerse yourself in the world of ramen. From selecting ingredients to make the soup, the type of noodle, sauce, and aroma oil, to a variety of toppings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a ramen universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/f1c279b1929a23c514013cf579020266.poster.avif?t=1743044969\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/f1c279b1929a23c514013cf579020266.webm?t=1743044969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/f1c279b1929a23c514013cf579020266.mp4?t=1743044969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf5c <strong>Authentic or Unique?</strong> \u2013 Craft traditional ramen with classic ingredients or experiment with bold, creative flavors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd62 <strong>Endless Customization</strong> \u2013 Choose from a huge variety of broths, noodles, toppings, and seasonings to build your perfect bowl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Create Your Signature Menu</strong> \u2013 Design your own personalized ramen menu to show off your culinary style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 <strong>Ramen Mt.Fuji Mode</strong> \u2013 Stack toppings as high as possible in this fun, chaotic challenge to create the tallest ramen tower ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Special Challenges &amp; Events</strong> \u2013 Test your skills in themed events and unlock exclusive ingredients and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73 <strong>Become a Ramen Legend</strong> \u2013 Build your reputation, earn achievements, and become the ultimate ramen master!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you love ramen? Do you want to make your own ramen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/aae6df6e2b7e2d475e9c7d3382f9a4bc.poster.avif?t=1743044969\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/aae6df6e2b7e2d475e9c7d3382f9a4bc.webm?t=1743044969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/aae6df6e2b7e2d475e9c7d3382f9a4bc.mp4?t=1743044969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will make your dream come true; you will be fascinated and immerse yourself in the world of ramen. From selecting ingredients to make the soup, the type of noodle, sauce, and aroma oil, to a variety of toppings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a ramen universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/f1c279b1929a23c514013cf579020266.poster.avif?t=1743044969\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/f1c279b1929a23c514013cf579020266.webm?t=1743044969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/f1c279b1929a23c514013cf579020266.mp4?t=1743044969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf5c <strong>Authentic or Unique?</strong> \u2013 Craft traditional ramen with classic ingredients or experiment with bold, creative flavors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd62 <strong>Endless Customization</strong> \u2013 Choose from a huge variety of broths, noodles, toppings, and seasonings to build your perfect bowl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Create Your Signature Menu</strong> \u2013 Design your own personalized ramen menu to show off your culinary style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 <strong>Ramen Mt.Fuji Mode</strong> \u2013 Stack toppings as high as possible in this fun, chaotic challenge to create the tallest ramen tower ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Special Challenges &amp; Events</strong> \u2013 Test your skills in themed events and unlock exclusive ingredients and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73 <strong>Become a Ramen Legend</strong> \u2013 Build your reputation, earn achievements, and become the ultimate ramen master!</p>",
    "short_description": "Ever dreamed of crafting the perfect bowl of ramen? In Ramen Simulator, you can unleash your creativity and build your own unique ramen style!",
